@description Lukashev Graphite (REAPER theme)
@version 27
@author Ilia Lukashev
@changelog
  Mixer: selected strip marked over its full height (blue wash + accent edges)
  Slightly deeper indicator colours (FX/rec/routing); mute and solo keep full brightness
  Arrange grid: subtle measure/beat/sub-beat lines
  Mixer insert area ruled with thin lines; TCP FX slots centred vertically
@provides
  Lukashev Graphite 27.ReaperThemeZip
@about
  Minimal, high-res theme based on Default 7 with Apple HIG-inspired colours,
  a light arrange area and flat controls for long, comfortable sessions.
  After installing: Options > Themes > Lukashev Graphite 27.
